     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thank you Stephane.  Apologies for the horrendously formatted code; I&#39;ve tried so many things, and I did not go back and clean it up before posting. <br><br>That worked, thank you.  I tried to use &#39;observe&#39; and enable but I did not do things quite right. <br><br>Now, my problem is that the column name that I finally get into my choice box is not getting passed to the renderPlot.  At least I can now select it before the plot tab is selected.  That is an improvement.  <br></div>"
    ],
